        <mxCell id="tool-u0n" value="&lt;b&gt;Why this exists&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The provider may already have accepted the request (email sent, payment made). A blind retry could do it twice. Each connector declares an &lt;b&gt;idempotency class&lt;/b&gt; at onboarding, and that class decides what happens next." style="shape=note;size=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;shadow=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="tool-unk">
