        <mxCell id="tool-cc_b" value="• tool JSON Schemas (input + output)&lt;br&gt;• risk tier per tool (R0 – R3)&lt;br&gt;• idempotency class (A / B / C) + reconcile() for class B&lt;br&gt;• rate limits and Retry-After handling&lt;br&gt;• egress domains (allowlist entries) · OAuth scopes (least privilege)&lt;br&gt;• timeout per tool · max payload size&lt;br&gt;• passes the fault-injection suite: 429 · 5xx · timeout · crash-after-send" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1E293B;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="tool-cc">
