        <mxCell id="ws-transp" value="&lt;b&gt;Works like a real colleague, never a hidden one.&lt;/b&gt; Same accounts, tools, calendar, laptop and responsibilities, but always identifiable as an AI employee (name, profile, meeting announcement). This keeps the kit within recording-consent laws and AI-transparency rules (e.g. EU AI Act Art. 50) and keeps the trust of customers and staff." style="shape=note;size=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;shadow=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="ws-idl">
