        <mxCell id="brain-title" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:24px&quot;&gt;Employee Brain: one cognitive system per AI employee&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#CBD5E1&quot;&gt;Identity · working memory · five long-term memory stores · four sharing scopes. Recall is fast and bounded; remembering is asynchronous, idempotent and governed.&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;shadow=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
