        <mxCell id="bdm-brel_b" value="read and write paths are separate deployments: ingestion backlog never slows recall&lt;br&gt;recall cache (Valkey) holds identity + rules per employee; brain-api down → harness uses cached core&lt;br&gt;all writes idempotent on source event id · consolidation is a Temporal workflow per employee (resumable)&lt;br&gt;pg-brain: 3 instances · sync quorum · PITR: memories are restorable to any second" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1E293B;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="bdm-brel">
